  "steps": [
    "Cook the rice noodles according to the packet instructions until tender but still slightly springy. Drain, rinse under cold water until cool, then drain very well.",
    "Whisk the peanut butter, lime juice, tamari, maple syrup, sesame oil, grated ginger, grated garlic, chilli and salt in a large bowl. Add 2 to 4 tbsp cold water as needed until the dressing is smooth and pourable.",
    "Add the cooled noodles, carrot, cucumber, red pepper, red cabbage and spring onions to the bowl. Toss thoroughly until everything is evenly coated in the dressing.",
    "Fold through most of the coriander, mint and chopped peanuts, keeping a little back for garnish.",
    "Taste and adjust with extra lime juice or salt if needed. Serve topped with the remaining herbs and peanuts."
